# Build context is the repo root (apps/api/Dockerfile). Keep it small and
# never send local secrets or build output into an image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
.cache
.remember
memory
docs
setupScripts
apps/ml
apps/worker
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
